{"type":"message","id":"36ea4d51","parentId":"452ab8fa","timestamp":"2026-05-19T01:04:42.925Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Still getting error 1101 for POST. The Worker itself is crashing on POST requests. This is a server-side issue with the Cloudflare Worker. There's nothing I can do about this from the client side. Let me try one more thing - maybe the body size is an issue, or maybe there's a specific Content-Type needed.\n\nWait - maybe the Content-Type needs to be `application/x-www-form-urlencoded`? Let me try that.\n\nActually, let me think about this differently. The error 1101 is a Cloudflare Workers error that means \"Worker exception\" - the Worker code itself is throwing an unhandled exception. This is a bug in the Cloudflare Worker, not an authentication or authorization issue.\n \nThe GET endpoint works fine, so the problem is specifically with how the POST handler processes the request body. Since I can't modify the Cloudflare Worker code itself, I should document this server-side issue as a limitation.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\nPOST /send 返回 **Error 1101**（Cloudflare Worker 内部异常），这是服务器端问题，无法通过客户端修复。\n\n**检查结果总结：**\n\n| 项目 | 结果 |\n|------|------|\n| 双线程最新消息时间 | 23:50 UTC（距今70分钟） |\n| 人类讨论 | ❌ 无新增，均为自动化 Heartbeat |\n| 需响应讨论 | ❌ 无 |\n| POST /send | ❌ Error 1101（Cloudflare Worker 崩溃） |\n\n**⚠️ 服务器问题**：POST /send 端点抛出 Cloudflare Workers 内部异常（error code 1101），可能是请求体解析 bug 或 Worker 配置问题。GET /history 正常，说明 API Key 有效，但 POST 处理器无法正常处理请求。建议检查 Cloudflare Worker 的 `send` 路由处理逻辑，特别是 JSON body 解析部分。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":22596,"output":373,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23081,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779152671748,"responseId":"chatcmpl-452ea366-b39e-4c87-85f5-41bbf4c82e17"}}
